-5d4d-a8c1-8097498b50b9" :question/math-academy-id "q-161511" :question/problem "What is the value of $f(t)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2}-3),\\,\\sqrt{2t},\\,{t}^{5}⟩$ at $t=2?$" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate, we substitute $t=2$ into the function, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2) & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({2}^{2}-3),\\sqrt{2(2)},{2}^{5}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1),\\sqrt{4},{2}^{5}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,2,32⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the value of $f(t)$ at $t=2$ is the vector $⟨0,2,32⟩.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-161511/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26571ec1-e645-5f07-ba4e-75c22558394a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-161511"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-160776/selection/c34b3d0deded1997cc7724ef57f803186fab83bf906ccbb31286bbd1c89d736f" :answer/id #uuid "577e3102-deff-5eee-98f2-1f101676421b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,i+2\\,j+16\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160776/selection/f19886ee7578539144f73f3aedc7157f16b923f0f0dd37e59452a6e1d2c426c3" :answer/id #uuid "a8cdf08b-251f-568b-8ca0-95067dbca6a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160776/selection/9084aa017c4b95d73bb2656621594b25f10fba2b41f15faea66079c27e380b1e" :answer/id #uuid "f1c8e759-c0ce-5274-9338-241596b7ed67" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\,j" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160776/selection/3402c366484ce627a7f4a6b012d6592ff68a58b8f5794fbe4dd1f65c93088c2e" :answer/id #uuid "8dee0141-ee47-5f4c-a7ce-e6959d32d8dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,i+2\\,j-16\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-160776/selection/561563a4524c82a9504e08ef8f06e6f18b87b8bfa267705488a09b7d7d87a363" :answer/id #uuid "b0f36f45-c831-5c27-8eae-05f459e7303c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,i+16\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q