⟩.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-161509/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26571ec1-e645-5f07-ba4e-75c22558394a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-161509"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-348693/field-1/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" :answer/id #uuid "08edd9c0-ba63-5ad6-91de-5442586c9005" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-348693/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "d2db978f-561d-5f77-83e4-a92f3f23e881" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-348693/field-1/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" :answer-field/choices ["q-348693/field-1/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-348693" :question/id #uuid "5be0218a-416b-5870-bd64-765410da524e" :question/math-academy-id "q-348693" :question/problem "Given that $r(t)=⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t),\\,\\sqrt{t+3},\\,t-1⟩,$ what is $|r(1)|?$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$|r(1)|=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Evaluating the function at $t=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(1) & =⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi ),\\,\\sqrt{4},\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(1)| & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-348693/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e520dc67-3b63-5ca7-959b-f642d85529d6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-348693"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-348690/field-1/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" :answer/id #uuid "734c3ee4-c63b-5b2d-9d50-556990311461" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-348690/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "d14f86ac-dcff-55d2-b3b7-af471d436804" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-348690/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "278e6af9-b46e-5157-8bf0-7abeb45e27e5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-348690/field-1/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" :answer-field/choices ["q-348690/field-1/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" "q-348690/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-348690" :question/id #uuid "ae45ac93-c493-5bb4-93c6-95e53a04e9aa" :question/math-academy-id "q-348690" :question/problem "Given that $r(t)=⟨cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi t}{2}),\\,\\sqrt{{t}^{3}-4},\\,ln\\,(2\\,{e}^{t-2}-1)⟩,$ what is $|r(2)|?$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$|r(2)|=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Evaluating the function at $t=2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(2) & =⟨cos\\,(\\frac{2\\pi }{2}),\\,\\sqrt{{2}^{3}-4},\\,ln\\,(2\\,{e}^{0}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi ),\\,\\sqrt{4},\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(2)| & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+4+0} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-348690/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e520dc67-3b63-5ca7-959b-f642d85529d6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-348690"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123284/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "d6ec60fd-2b88-52